    "source": "<section class=\"uip-layout-item\" data-uip-node=\"node_67dba64a-9624-49bc-a05c-21e50a81e659\">\n<div class=\"uip-layout-item\" data-uip-node=\"node_7766ebba-0ba0-44e6-9923-3fc226d6b452\">\n  <h2 data-uip-node=\"node_21084fce-edc2-44bb-96c1-5ff68993dced\">Introduction</h2>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"uip-layout-item\" data-uip-node=\"node_6a319346-418c-4a41-9e51-7b8b6356d168\">\n  <p data-uip-node=\"node_7d9a5602-0b88-44b0-9e30-e79204a6e6cf\">Discover a Swiss mountain landscape and plan a peaceful escape.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"uip-layout-item\" data-uip-node=\"node_e09a567c-78d4-4185-ad4b-8c7c7bfd821b\">\n  <a data-uip-node=\"node_e2e22bb1-203a-458f-b8dd-f53aa3e2e488\" href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Fronalpstock_big.jpg\">Explore the landscape photograph</a>\n</div>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"uip-layout-item\" data-uip-node=\"node_75b6a400-7bbc-44bd-84b7-8f1899250032\">\n  <section data-uip-node=\"node_2a45d433-4110-439c-b771-e375faa52fb1\">\n<div class=\"uip-layout-item\" data-uip-node=\"node_93dd628a-5e8f-4a7b-baaf-71073de463c7\">\n  <h2 data-uip-node=\"node_3bf64c89-8c55-42f4-9fde-bb9659c1c8b5\">Feature</h2>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"uip-layout-item\" data-uip-node=\"node_3acfa7d2-4047-4c09-9097-631113157422\">\n  <p data-uip-node=\"node_b1885c51-3da8-4008-aac1-2290179611b4\">Mountain views, clear water and a quiet place to pause.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"uip-layout-item\" data-uip-node=\"node_e9f55c8d-8011-4627-b9e3-6272b8eff213\">\n  <img data-uip-node=\"node_2d400743-4104-4527-b759-97c7443ce6f6\" alt=\"Mountain landscape overlooking a lake in Switzerland\" src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3f/Fronalpstock_big.jpg\">\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"uip-layout-item\" data-uip-node=\"node_ea7861a6-b7c3-4bac-9c7a-1e8dcf9c4034\">\n  <uib-card data-uip-node=\"node_35f22e20-2ee0-4825-be78-b785ccd195f0\" data-uip-component=\"cmp_platform_5d42b928-83bf-4b18-a4c0-48b06c2efa1\" heading=\"A moment in the mountains\"><span data-uip-node=\"node_6547a25e-2e4e-4fdb-89e5-04e4f225f79d\">Build your next quiet escape around a view worth remembering.</span></uib-card>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"uip-layout-item\" data-uip-node=\"node_874ed0a4-f1df-44d0-aa3e-eb636442c4b2\">\n  <section data-uip-node=\"node_1bde28f5-5cf6-424e-ab8b-c2917e1f0001\">\n<div class=\"uip-layout-item\" data-uip-node=\"node_0d1fe123-d3c2-4250-b142-f3cffca675ac\">\n  <h2 data-uip-node=\"node_c4198b4f-8bab-4624-8c21-12b8b8f2252e\">Closing</h2>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"uip-layout-item\" data-uip-node=\"node_7a000fc6-5204-4a96-b2c4-a439cee9f4da\">\n  <p data-uip-node=\"node_2b7df4d5-3818-457b-b9ed-618188547805\">Thank you for exploring. Contact us to plan your next visit.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"uip-layout-item\" data-uip-node=\"node_8519ab54-1217-41fe-abdd-88eabef3156a\">\n  <a data-uip-node=\"node_0a403ec1-7e2d-4998-a569-3b2cd290e998\" href=\"mailto:hello@example.com\">Contact the planning team</a>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n",
